        "original_id": "6a9417d0-a153-5703-8cc7-d58e5460416d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Dandong, Hotan, Yotkan, Liaoning, Xinjiang, China\n- Companies: SG Automotive Group Co Ltd, Liaoning Shuguang Automotive Group, Ltd\n- Historical entities: Kingdom of Khotan\n\nFacts:\n- Dandong, formerly known as Andong, is a prefecture-level city in southeastern Liaoning province in the People's Republic of China.\n- Hotan, also transliterated from Chinese as Hetian, is a major oasis town in southwestern Xinjiang in western China.\n- The ancient capital of the Kingdom of Khotan was originally located west of modern-day Hotan at Yotkan.\n- SG Automotive Group Co Ltd, officially Liaoning Shuguang Automotive Group, Ltd, is a Chinese vehicle and component manufacturer headquartered in Dandong, Liaoning province.",
